### II. ARCHITECTURAL MECHANICS & INVARIANT COMPLIANCE

1. **Preservation of Somatic Non-Coercion (Chapter I, Invariant 1.2)**:  
   Denial of an unsubstantiated caregiver exemption does not trigger physical coercion, bodily conscription, or penal servitude. Unsubstantiated claims revert automatically to the standard civic reciprocity roster. Persistent refusal triggers non-coercive Stage 1 Administrative Remediation and metabolic decoupling (throttling of discretionary fabrication quotas and regional transit permissions), leaving bodily autonomy fully inviolate.

2. **Preservation of Universal Survival Baseline (Chapter I, Invariant 1.3)**:  
   Under no circumstance does an administrative reclassification or revocation of an invalid care claim throttle or terminate indivisible Class-A lifesupport (potable water, basic metabolic caloric rationing, dwelling shelter, emergency medicine, sanitation). The remedy operates purely on civic reciprocity accounting, discretionary public commons access, and sortition eligibility.

3. **Demographic Rationality & Biophysical Ledgering (Article 5.6.1.1 & 5.6.2.1)**:  
   By fixing the statutory ratio to one full-time adult caregiver per registered dependent—unless specialized multi-person clinical protocols are validated through the Bioregional Health Commons—the systemic moral-hazard loophole is closed mathematically. Sortition panels operate as empirical arbiters of documented functional criteria rather than targets of affective rhetoric.

